        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.77082824707031,
        125.70940399169922,
        98.6268310546875
      ],
      "text": "4.5\t I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        85.77763366699219,
        310.2434997558594,
        97.57682800292969
      ],
      "text": "mplementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        108.97604370117188,
        257.73138427734375,
        123.196044921875
      ],
      "text": "Revised dosages and regimens",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.65054321289062,
        513.448974609375,
        145.071044921875
      ],
      "text": "(6)  The recent revision  of recommendations for dosages and regimens for the treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        147.716064453125,
        513.3916015625,
        161.06756591796875
      ],
      "text": "of TB in children, although evidence-based, has resulted in significant challenges for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        163.71258544921875,
        513.4718627929688,
        177.0640869140625
      ],
      "text": "implementation. The major problem is that currently available FDCs do not match the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        179.7091064453125,
        513.41455078125,
        193.06060791015625
      ],
      "text": "new, higher doses. The recent recommendations require an H:R ratio of 2:3, i.e. H 10",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        195.70562744140625,
        513.4144897460938,
        209.05712890625
      ],
      "text": "mg/kg with R 15 mg/kg; the previous recommendations required an H:R ratio of 1:2,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        211.7021484375,
        513.4949951171875,
        225.05364990234375
      ],
      "text": "i.e. H 5 mg/kg with R 10 mg/kg. The FDCs currently available for use in children have an",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        227.69866943359375,
        513.5064086914062,
        241.0501708984375
      ],
      "text": "H:R ratio of 1:2 (e.g. 30 mg H with 60 mg R) or 1:1 (e.g. 60 mg H with 60 mg R). This",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        243.62619018554688,
        513.3916015625,
        257.04669189453125
      ],
      "text": "(6) makes it difficult to achieve isoniazid dosages of 10-15 mg/kg   while staying within",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        259.69171142578125,
        513.3683471679688,
        273.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "the upper limit for dosages of rifampicin and pyrazinamide – which is critical to maintain",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        275.688232421875,
        245.6138916015625,
        289.03973388671875
      ],
      "text": "a very low risk of hepatotoxicity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        300.19476318359375,
        513.41455078125,
        313.5462646484375
      ],
      "text": "Attempts are being made to resolve this issue. Agreement has been reached on the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        316.1912841796875,
        513.3570556640625,
        329.54278564453125
      ],
      "text": "composition of a more suitable FDC for the future, containing RHZ with an H:R ratio of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        332.1877746582031,
        513.4718627929688,
        345.5392761230469
      ],
      "text": "2:3, but it is likely to be some years before this is available. Further, the recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        348.18426513671875,
        513.448974609375,
        361.5357666015625
      ],
      "text": "dosage range for isoniazid has been extended to 7-15 mg/kg (see Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        364.1807556152344,
        513.4605102539062,
        377.5322570800781
      ],
      "text": "8 and Table 3 above). Extending the dosage range facilitates both the interim use of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        380.17724609375,
        513.4719848632812,
        393.52874755859375
      ],
      "text": "the currently available FDC without the need for additional isoniazid tablets (Annex 5)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        396.1737365722656,
        513.4835205078125,
        409.5252380371094
      ],
      "text": "and the use of a more suitable FDC in the future, while at the same time ensuring that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        412.17022705078125,
        513.4488525390625,
        425.521728515625
      ],
      "text": "adequate blood levels are achieved, notably in the very young children or isoniazid fast",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        428.09771728515625,
        345.93988037109375,
        441.5182189941406
      ],
      "text": "(3) acetylators who are at greatest risk for low levels .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        455.3839111328125,
        280.8553771972656,
        469.6039123535156
      ],
      "text": "Treatment response and follow-up",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        478.1274108886719,
        513.4259643554688,
        491.4789123535156
      ],
      "text": "Treatment outcomes in children are generally good provided that treatment starts",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        494.1239013671875,
        513.4374389648438,
        507.47540283203125
      ],
      "text": "promptly and adherence is maintained until completion. The risk of serious adverse",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        510.0514221191406,
        513.4373779296875,
        523.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "(5, 9) events in children associated with use of the recommended treatment regimens   is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        526.1168823242188,
        513.3800659179688,
        539.4683837890625
      ],
      "text": "very low. Severe disseminated disease such as tuberculous meningitis is associated with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        542.1133422851562,
        361.07391357421875,
        555.46484375
      ],
      "text": "high mortality and with high morbidity among survivors.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        566.619873046875,
        513.4373779296875,
        579.9713745117188
      ],
      "text": "Ideally, each child should be assessed at least at the following intervals: 2 weeks after",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        582.6163940429688,
        513.4029541015625,
        595.9678955078125
      ],
      "text": "the start of treatment, at the end of the intensive phase, and every 2 months until",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        598.6128540039062,
        513.4719848632812,
        611.96435546875
      ],
      "text": "completion of treatment. The assessment should include, as a minimum: symptom",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        614.609375,
        513.4144897460938,
        627.9608764648438
      ],
      "text": "assessment, assessment of treatment adherence, enquiry about any adverse events,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        630.6058959960938,
        513.4029541015625,
        643.9573974609375
      ],
      "text": "and weight measurement. Dosages should be adjusted to take account of any weight",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        646.6024169921875,
        513.3798217773438,
        659.9539184570312
      ],
      "text": "gain. Adherence should be assessed by reviewing the treatment card. A follow-up",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        662.5989379882812,
        513.3684692382812,
        675.950439453125
      ],
      "text": "sputum sample for smear microscopy at 2 months after the start of treatment should",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        678.5953979492188,
        513.46044921875,
        691.9468994140625
      ],
      "text": "be obtained from any child who was smear-positive at diagnosis. Follow-up chest X-rays",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.5919189453125,
        513.4833374023438,
        707.9434204101562
      ],
      "text": "are not routinely required in children who are improving with treatment, particularly as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        710.5884399414062,
        413.4794616699219,
        723.93994140625
      ],
      "text": "many children will have a slow radiographic response to treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        735.0949096679688,
        513.426025390625,
        748.4464111328125
      ],
      "text": "A child who is not responding to anti-TB treatment should be referred for further",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        751.0914306640625,
        513.3800048828125,
        764.4429321289062
      ],
      "text": "assessment and management. This child may have a drug-resistant TB, an unusual",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        767.087890625,
        513.3915405273438,
        780.4393920898438
      ],
      "text": "complication of pulmonary TB, a lung disease from another cause or problems with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        783.0844116210938,
        190.6783905029297,
        796.4359130859375
      ],
      "text": "treatment adherence.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "38",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}